:"\u003chttps://twitter.com/manboumuseum|@manboumuseum\u003e: テレビ取材「マンボウの天敵はなんですか？」\n私「人類です」\nテレビ取材「……」\n\nテレビ放送「マンボウの天敵はサメです」\n私「ﾊ(ｷﾟДﾟ)(ﾟДﾟﾒ)ｧ!?」","id":1,"author_name":"マンボウ博士（求職中）＠マンボウをまん延防止等重点措置のイメージキャラクターにしよう","author_subname":"@manboumuseum","author_link":"https://twitter.com/manboumuseum/status/1388671498718642178","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/980336967228432384/sRiWYQ0t_normal.jpg","text":"テレビ取材「マンボウの天敵はなんですか？」\n私「人類です」\nテレビ取材「……」\n\nテレビ放送「マンボウの天敵はサメです」\n私「ﾊ(ｷﾟДﾟ)(ﾟДﾟﾒ)ｧ!?」","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1619920060,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/manboumuseum/status/1388671498718642178?s=21","original_url":"https://twitter.com/manboumuseum/status/1388671498718642178?s=21"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"thinca","count":8,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01D44KSY9Z","U06ECBRTJ","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS","U8CC7MDCL","U013QL1RAPN","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0vtFF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60c473df-b1e0-4a4a-ad7c-2463a851ca32","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1619918278.166500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vZs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8992b5d-beb6-4666-9b3d-716181b649ff","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こんなのじゃないですかね。","ts":"1619891756.166100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jLQA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b66cf50-1502-4e56-b39f-a7e3c7855001","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://gist.github.com/mattn/7ab868207c9feb67fc2c71ed7b73a452\u003e","ts":"1619891753.165800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qi5jy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f690479-d071-4d4b-a12a-49193ce374c1","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"next を取る度に必ずカウントを減らすんです。","ts":"1619889762.165600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hoU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4f8f6a2-1345-4510-bae3-8eb8bbeac0cc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; じゃぁカウントは使用中って意味で実装すると失敗しそう。\nというと？","ts":"1619889618.165300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OstYO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e125c2e-ea89-43b1-b84c-cfd73ba7deb8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分も全部は読んでいないんですが↓には詳しく書いてあると思います\n\u003chttps://www.interdb.jp/pg/pgsql08.html\u003e","ts":"1619889584.165000","attachments":[{"fallback":"The Internals of PostgreSQL : Chapter 8 Buffer Manager","id":1,"title":"The Internals of PostgreSQL : Chapter 8 Buffer Manager","title_link":"https://www.interdb.jp/pg/pgsql08.html","text":"This chapter describes the buffer manager in PostgreSQL in details.","blocks":null,"service_name":"interdb.jp","service_icon":"https://www.interdb.jp/./assets/img/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.interdb.jp/pg/pgsql08.html","original_url":"https://www.interdb.jp/pg/pgsql08.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"df/9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff7ce62e-1bb3-4db4-8aed-798c6dda27f2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"じゃぁカウントは使用中って意味で実装すると失敗しそう。","ts":"1619889529.164400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dp+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e055b347-3110-484c-98b3-a21c9a720dc4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"使用頻度が低いものを再利用","ts":"1619889499.163900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tZL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30afe077-47fc-4a26-89dd-308a625acb28","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"バッファは縮まらないみたいですね","ts":"1619889480.163400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iB5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"320b5cec-750e-4416-a8a1-d85961e2713f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あー、LRU の変則として使いたいのか。であれば固定長の方がいいって話かな。","ts":"1619889463.163100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pxIvm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7095d556-6185-48d3-ab34-2bcd61343a4a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それはそうというか、まぁそうですよね、くらいの認識なんですが、検索の時にスキップするくらいなら連結リストでいいやんという話でした。","ts":"1619889180.162400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"46W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37c37280-2531-4b03-afe5-1fdd374fe464","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分もよくわかっていないんですが、使用回数をカウントしておき、それが少ない、つまりバッファの利用頻度が低いものから再利用するようにしていて、\n参照カウンタはバッファを参照している、つまり使用中かかどうかを意味しているので、使用中であればバッファは再利用しないという理解です","ts":"1619888763.160200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t+f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bc42857-b168-4b17-ad0e-38d1935c3c0e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"どうせ参照カウントが 0 になったらリスト縮めなあかんし realloc, memmove するのしんどいから連結リストだろうし。","ts":"1619888352.156600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/py"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca9cad49-86c5-4f0a-ade8-b62493f8a283","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"↑ に出てきた clock sweep、普通に参照カウンタやんって気がしたけど何が違うんやろ。","ts":"1619888304.155700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4iU8r"}]}]
